Scaled rows are monotone in the hidden order, so those parts of skills 0 and 3 are confirmed, but the remaining rows in skills 2 and 3 are not. I am writing a one-pass decoder (counted votes and value maps, no weights touched) and testing it on 20% of answers I hide from it, and I expect high accuracy on skills 0 and 1 and lower on 2 and 3.

